-- Broker Wallet local seed file.
--
-- Stage 1 intentionally does not seed production subscription products, quota limits,
-- app versions, or user/business data because those values are either product-owner
-- decisions or will be generated by tests. `supabase db reset` still loads this file so
-- future development-only fixtures have a stable home.
--
-- IMPORTANT: `supabase db push` does not apply this seed file to the hosted project.
